    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Sir, your coffee."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "\u2014Are you new?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I am, sir."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "Then ask around about how I take my coffee. Bring it to me again once you let it cool!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "You damned Feline\u2014eugh, a Feline! You disgusting wretch! I didn't go to war to have a Feline take care of me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "Get out of my sight!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$bottlebroken",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "My utmost apologies, sir, this is my oversight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Please don't tell the head caretaker. I'll prepare it again for you right away..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "Hmph! If you don't want to lose your job, you have three minutes to do it over, properly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "Also... is something wrong with your eyes? If you don't know how to smile, I'll tear that face of yours off."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Please don't... I'm very sorry to displease you. I'll go and redo it right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Veteran-Like Person",
        "text": "Peh. Servants these days. Is a nice figure all they have to offer?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I am very sorry, sir. Please do not get angry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It would be highly detrimental to your condition."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Officer",
        "text": "Out of the way!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Yes, yes. Very sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
