    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "Miss? Hey, Miss!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Are you referring to me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "Yeah, that's right. Miss, I saw the whole thing just now. Don't you lose heart."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "That's a Patrol Unit head... you know, you could say, people like that have no right coming to the retreat."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "He certainly isn't a noble... Does he not worry about offending others, acting so tyrannically?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "They say some count's very fond of him... ah, and not just that. Coming here for his 'battlefield condition?' I heard that's hokum. Bet he hasn't stepped foot on a battlefield in his life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "I heard he helped the count do some dirty work, and got sent here so he could keep his head down. With a supporter like that, and with people like us, of course he lets all hell's bells loose."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...A count..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I never imagined a scoundrel like that could climb high enough to befriend a count."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "That's how it is! Who knows when one day he'll be made some lord of somewhere! Dressed all clean and fine and sitting behind some enormous desk... agh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "Anyway, don't you get angry. Piss off people like that, and you'll wish it was an Originium Slug stuck to you instead. What on Terra is a fine young girl like you even doing, working out here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "Never tell anyone I told you this, and don't go asking about, or else you'll get burnt!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Yes... I understand. Thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Caretaker",
        "text": "Ack. The next you see him, stay away a little. Heaven knows what he'll do to you\u2014ah, is that the new doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
