    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. Louisa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "It's just us two right now, Kal'tsit. You should be using an alias."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "'Louisa.' Borrowing your daughter's name. A disguise of that level is purely for humiliating the Secret Police."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "In their eyes, I am already dead. And after this incident, I'll leave Ursus, and may not be able to return for a very long time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Nobody will know the Grand Duke's death was a murder. The next time they come to the Grand Duke's side, they will only discover that in his old age, his breathing stopped."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Will Ursus technology not be enough to analyze the poison you've made?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "At present, I assure you this exceeds their understanding of what a 'poison' is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "For how many years can your knowledge stay ahead of Ursus? Director?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The Empire's progress has already surpassed what I imagined, but these are not details we need to discuss right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Lillia, your hoped-for arbitration can only end in this way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "None of you have the means to seek further revenge; it is unreasonable. Only the paramount Emperor of Ursus would be capable of erasing the Grand Duke's honor, significance, and all else."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "...I know..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Good. In that case, is this the place?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Yes. We have no idea what Grand Duke Vanya is chronically afflicted with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "But I found out from the head caretaker that every afternoon at three, Vanya will leave his own monitoring room, and come here to relax."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "He sunbathes here until sunset. When he has the occasional guests, he'll have his dinner right here with them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "There's no way we can get close to the Grand Duke's room, but as for here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We're standing right here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "But he won't be without bodyguards. The whole corridor will be sealed off when the time comes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Apart from any guests cleared to be with the Grand Duke, only his medical adviser, as well as the servants, are allowed to enter this area."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even so, the Ursus nobles won't permit the workers to come to this balcony freely."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We've already waited for long enough. The longer we spend, the riskier this gets."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "I understand. There has to be some gap, there has to be an opening... the Grand Duke's medical advisers work in shifts, so it might be me before we know it. Today, or perhaps tomorrow."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Lillia, tell me the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "After the Grand Duke dies, what will you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Why ask this now? We should be focusing on what's before us\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I'm hoping you can answer me with reality."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Before we reached Pine Valley, I received one final letter from Vampilov's family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Sergei is still diligently serving Boris, and the city... has changed course. Perhaps this is the start of something changing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "They killed so many people... yet their conscience is still so clear. They rest so easily..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You found out about Sergei's betrayal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "But no excuse can bring back the dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Sergei can't offer any further scientific assistance. Perhaps in a few years, they'll formally call a halt to the project. And then? I just sit back and watch Sergei and Boris continue to collude, to trample over everything?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Though Grand Duke Vanya will be dead, you don't plan to stop."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "There's no way I can pardon Sergei. The first time I met him, Astrov was drunk, hugging me so excited, telling me all about how he had such upstanding, excellent colleagues."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "He looked forward to this project like no one else, and I supported him. I supported him with all I could."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Even up to now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Director Kal'tsit, you know everything, don't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "If you won't speak up, I'll return to Chernobog. I'll settle things once and for all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Vampilov's family have an escape route to Sami ready for me, but maybe, I wouldn't get the chance to hitchhike with any Messengers. And you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I do plan to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Heh... of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "I'm very well aware, I'm setting myself alight. So... Kal'tsit, no matter whether you plan to confess all the facts to me or not, at the very least there's one tiny thing I want you to agree to."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "I know I'm doing something insane right now, and I know maybe you're the one in the right. But right now, I only have one request. Look after my daughter. Look after Louisa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "The next generation doesn't need to inherit the hassle of hatred... Even if nobody can escape this cycle in the end, at least promise me, Kal'tsit. Look after her. If you can, please look after Lyudmila too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Caretaker's Voice",
        "text": "Dr. Louisa? Dr. Louisa, where are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_168_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Here! Please wait one moment!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Kal'tsit... I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I promise you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This is simply a mother's final wish. I will see Louisa grow up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Astrov\u2014the last time he held little Louisa's hand, he told me something, half-jokingly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "He said, he hoped little Louisa would become a medical researcher just like me, and when Louisa was old enough to go to school, he hoped you'd be her very first teacher."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lillia",
        "text": "Those were the very last words he said to his daughter before he suddenly went to the Institute that night."
    },
