    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "As for the Grand Duke's invitation, I do regret that my Messenger is still waiting for me, and I can't stay so long."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Do pass a message on to Vanya. Tell him to rest up with peace of mind here. Though he should remember, also, that this is a meritorious place for those Our Majesty gives favor, and not another social hub for the nobility to mingle in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082",
            "name2": "avg_npc_076",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Officer",
        "text": "Ah... got it, got it... if you could just hold on... the Grand Duke will be very sad to hear."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082",
            "name2": "avg_npc_076",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "This is official business. If I have to choose between Our Majesty and the Grand Duke, I'm forced to wrong the Grand Duke Vanya."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082",
            "name2": "avg_npc_076",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Officer",
        "text": "Ergh...! You should've spoke sooner! If that's so, the Grand Duke will surely empathize with you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Officer",
        "text": "May your road be evergreen."
